  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Portulaca quadrifida",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portulaca_quadrifida",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 1356239111,
      "text": "Portulaca quadrifida, known as pusley, wild purslane, chicken weed, single‑flowered purslane, small‑leaved purslane and 10 o'clock plant, is a species of flowering plant in the genus Portulaca, possibly native to Africa, but certainly widespread over the Old World Tropics, and introduced elsewhere. It is collected in the wild and eaten in salads or cooked, and is a favorite fodder for chickens and pigs."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Portulaca quadrifida",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portulaca_quadrifida",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 171583706,
      "text": "Portulaca quadrifida, conocida como verdolaga silvestre o verdolaga de flores pequeñas es una especie de planta angioesperma del género Portulaca, posiblemente originaria de África, pero extendida por los trópicos del Viejo Mundo y en otros lugares. Suele ser recolectada para consumirse en ensaladas o en cocción. Es un buen forraje para pollos y cerdos."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Portulaca quadrifida",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portulaca_quadrifida",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
      "revision": 29355534,
      "text": "Portulaca quadrifida, yang dikenal sebagai pusley, wild purslane, chicken weed, single‑flowered purslane, small‑leaved purslane dan 10 o'clock plant, adalah spesies tumbuhan berbunga dalam genus Portulaca. Tumbuhan ini kemungkinan berasal dari Afrika, namun tersebar luas di seluruh wilayah tropis Dunia Lama, dan telah diperkenalkan di tempat lain. Tumbuhan ini dikumpulkan di alam liar dan dimakan dalam salad atau dimasak, serta merupakan pakan favorit bagi ayam dan babi."
    }
  },
